      "name": "Naqshbandiyya",
      "alternateName": "نقشبندیہ",
      "description": "Order tracing to Baha ud-Din Naqshband Bukhari; emphasises silent dhikr and close adherence to shari'a.",
      "foundingDate": "c. 1389"
